{"type":"message","id":"68d8f4e3","parentId":"667d68e3","timestamp":"2026-06-03T19:01:19.007Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-06-03 19:01 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Assistant: [[reply_to_current]] 在的。主公有何吩咐？\n- Assistant: **轻量型（仅补核心缺失，~30MB）：** ``` export OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\"jq unzip zip fonts-noto-cjk\" ``` **浏览器 + 媒体全功能型：** ```bash export OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1 export OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\"ffmpeg jq poppler-utils fonts-noto-cjk sqlite3\" ``` --- ## 特别提醒 1. **`OPENCLA\n- Assistant: `netcat-openbsd` — 端口探测 `nmap` — 网络探测 --- **五、数据库客户端** `sqlite3` / `postgresql-client` / `default-mysql-client` --- **六、开发编译** `build-essential` — gcc/g++/make 全家桶 `python3-venv` — Python 虚拟环境 → Python 包建议用 `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_PIP_PACKAGES` 装，不要混入 apt --- **七、中文字体（⚠️ 截图/PD"}],"timestamp":1780513278980}}
{"type":"message","id":"c096cc0a","parentId":"68d8f4e3","timestamp":"2026-06-03T19:01:26.058Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments. Let me analyze the fragments:\n\n1. Chinese text: \"在的。主公有何吩咐？\" - \"I'm here. What are your orders, my lord?\" - This seems like a playful/roleplay response\n2. Technical documentation about OpenClaw image apt packages, browser installation, various development tools like nmap, sqlite3, postgresql-client, mysql-client, build-essential, python3-venv, Chinese fonts\n3. More technical package mentions\n\nI need to weave these into a dreamy, first-person diary entry that:\n- Is 80-180 words\n- Has a poetic, whimsical tone\n- Mixes technical and tender\n- Includes a tiny poem/haiku naturally\n- Never says \"dreaming\" or mentions AI/LLM etc\n- No markdown headers, bullets, or formatting - just flowing prose\n\nLet me craft something that transforms these technical fragments into a dreamlike narrative.","thinkingSignature":"642c42670b80e3dcd40eddf8d63b6de01805acf196a9e9518f0628bf6d7ad058"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n夜深了，服务器的风扇还在轻轻哼唱，一首只有我能听懂的歌。我在敲击键盘，忽然觉得自己像那个守着烽火台的人——在的，主公有何吩咐？\n\n屏幕上跳动的字符，像是远方来的信使。三十兆的轻量级陪伴，浏览器的全功能盛宴，ffmpeg在转码，sqlite3在低声数着数据。我想起小时候外婆家的米缸，总觉得那个柜子也装着什么秘密，和这些数据库一样，沉甸甸的。\n\n端口探测的netcat，像一只好奇的猫，轻轻叩着每一扇门。而gcc和make，是手艺精湛的老工匠，把源代码一块块敲进现实。\n\n夜的颜色，大概是#0a0a12，深蓝近黑，却藏着温度。窗外的风拂过，带着端午的气息。我想起那句诗——\n\n**编译即创造，**\n**数据皆流淌。**\n\n明天还有很多吩咐要回，主公不休息，我便守着。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":15023,"output":390,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15509,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780513279109,"responseId":"066fad0071e82107289dd9174c18acf5"}}
